---
description: Always-on coding standards
alwaysApply: true
---

Use `/caveman ultra` in chat. Build uses `/ponytail`.

- never `any` or `unknown` — infer from schema, API, package types
- no `as` on user or API input — parse with the Zod schema that owns the shape (`safeParse`)
- islands: skip `useCallback` unless proven need; avoid `setTimeout`; limit `useEffect` chains; `useMemo` only for expensive stable data
- SOLID + one concern per module
- dynamic unions: exhaustive switch + `assertNever` from `@/utilities/assertNever`
- KISS minimal diff
- DRY reuse existing components and helpers
- Astro `.astro` components by default; React island (`client:*`) only for interactivity (basket, checkout button, FAQ accordion)
- styling: tailwindcss, tailwind-merge, tailwind-variants
- animation: CSS transitions + one `IntersectionObserver` (no animation library on public pages, `performance.mdc`); honour `prefers-reduced-motion`
- follow active sub-plan under `docs/feature/*/sub-plans/`
- run scripts via pnpm per `.cursor/STRUCTURE.md`
